{
  "format": "sfxgen/1",
  "name": "Soft landing",
  "description": "The runner from \"Jump take-off\" coming back down on the same sprung gym floor, landing softly on the balls of the feet with the knees bent. First the forefoot: a padded slap of thick rubber sole and a dull, dense knock from the boards, the soles scrubbing as they grip. Then the second foot, a little lower and quieter, so it is two feet and not one drum. The soles bite the lacquer with a short falling sneaker chirp. Then the heels and the body's weight arrive, a lower, softer knock, while the tracksuit catches up and settles. A small gym answers quietly.",
  "tags": [
    "movement",
    "landing",
    "land",
    "jump",
    "footstep",
    "soft",
    "stealth",
    "sneaker",
    "player",
    "platformer",
    "foley"
  ],
